    "custom_media_with_content_HcjCad": {
      "type": "custom-media-with-content",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_D4qaqF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Turn Your Shower Into a Spa — In Seconds",
            "text_color": "#0c2331",
            "font_size": 32,
            "font_size_mob": 20,
            "font_weight": 700,
            "margin_bottom": 10,
            "margin_bottom_mob": 10
          }
        },
        "content_XbBAwk": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Shower steamers make luxury self-care effortless. Each one infuses your shower with real essential oils for instant aromatherapy. No tub needed. No cleanup. Just place it, steam it, breathe it in. The easiest upgrade to your daily routine.</p>",
            "text_color": "#0c2331",
            "font_size": 16,
            "font_size_mob": 16,
            "font_weight": 400,
            "margin_bottom": 20,
            "margin_bottom_mob": 20
          }
        },
        "review_wLyhaq": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_box_bg": "#e2edec",
            "review_box_border_color": "#00bcae",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/BR_image_1.png",
            "review_text": "<p>Iʼve used these in different homes over the holidays and they transformed each bathroom into a little oasis. You donʼt need a fancy tubor setup. Just hot water and a few minutes. Really nice upgrade to my usual shower.</p>",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mob": 14,
            "font_weight": 600,
            "margin_bottom": 10,
            "margin_bottom_mob": 10,
            "regards": "– Laurenthe Writer",
            "r_color": "#000000",
            "r_font_size": 14,
            "r_font_size_mob": 14,
            "r_font_weight": 900
          }
        }
      },
