          }
        },
        "content_GbMxND": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>When candles feel too basic and gift cards feel too impersonal, body restore shower steamers are the perfect solution. They’re luxurious, practical, and unexpected—the kind of gift people love discovering and actually use. From Mother’s Day to birthdays to thank-you gifts, it’s an easy win. And with bundle builder savings, custom gifting gets even better.</p>",
            "text_color": "#0c2331",
            "font_size": 16,
            "font_size_mob": 16,
            "font_weight": 400,
            "margin_bottom": 20,
            "margin_bottom_mob": 20
          }
        },
        "review_aFfbWC": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_box_bg": "#f6f0e2",
            "review_box_border_color": "#ff8f02",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/Enerzie.png",
            "review_text": "<p>“Makes a perfect gift. I was gifted these, from someone who knew I was going through a rough time. It was exactly what I didn’t know I needed. Now I gift them to others, it’s a small gesture, but it means a lot when someone is stressed or struggling.”</p>",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mob": 14,
            "font_weight": 600,
            "margin_bottom": 10,
            "margin_bottom_mob": 10,
            "regards": "– Mrs. McCool",
            "r_color": "#000000",
