        "content_PhzFiV": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Stress relief shouldn’t require an hour-long bath or a spa appointment. With Relief (Eucalyptus Mint), body restore delivers tension relief, clear breathing, and instant calm in the time it takes to shower. It's real self-care for real life.</p>",
