            "img": "shopify://shop_images/calm_757a87d5-e932-4547-855d-f9ce6a9221cd.png",
            "review_text": "<p>“My friend recommended these shower tablets to help with stress and anxiety. I didn’t realize how badly I needed something like this. I’m a caregiver for my mom and often don’t have time to decompress. These gave me 5 minutes of peace.”</p>",
