        "content_pAD7Jq": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Forget the chemical perfume clouds. Body Restore uses only real essential oils — no synthetics, no shortcuts. That’s why Energize smells like fresh citrus and Calm feels like lavender fields. It’s 100% clean aromatherapy that actually works.</p>",
            "text_color": "#0c2331",
            "font_size": 16,
